c_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxIU1AOGPEViq4AGhjzeHl4ftRh-geez1uy5qHcYSG1rA&oe=69C9034B"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wedR22TAC8EQ7kNvwE4hiYR&_nc_oc=Adoex5V6xfqu6GVVXpUK80iwz3Ce66fB3JI6J1odlS9XBFdbq0NVLx2Kbd5frCO8IJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzoa1rITj68bW56GvTT9v4xc52UqoU7SuZZqtEGMbzLXQ&oe=69C92F09"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aj8bkIZxsPgQ7kNvwEb9nvz&_nc_oc=AdqGPeTgK7Ko9S9rccFwidqkKHXIV0UOTWSGF__tvzu_Z1mExkcZw2pnMpjeKNQllEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyBJ-ROYCjdMuomHh99Zy7mQmtnMGrQxSfpFJEaVcjQ8A&oe=69C92D3D"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577